# Generic OLT for the pon core (WP-1007), served with the test profile
# testdata/generic-pon-profile.yaml: port 101 (pon0/1) with ten ONUs, the
# tenth offline after LOS, port 102 (pon0/2) with five ONUs online. Status
# .2 (online 1, offline 2), serial .3 (vendor letters + 4 octets), Rx at
# the ONU .4 and at the OLT .5 in 0.01 dBm, last down cause .6 (los 1,
# dying_gasp 2, other 3), distance .7 in metres; ONU 7 of pon0/1 receives
# -28.50 dBm (below the default -27 dBm).
